<div class="header">
  <div class="headertitle"><div class="title">MonoBehaviourSingleton&lt; T &gt; Class Template Reference</div></div>
</div><!--header-->
<div class="contents">

<p>This is a generic Singleton implementation for Monobehaviours. Create a derived class where the type T is the script you want to "Singletonize" Upon loading it will call DontDestroyOnLoad on the gameobject where this script is contained so it persists upon scene changes.  
 <a href="#details">More...</a></p>
